      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The fight against pain has been a government priority since 1998. With regard to the different plans put forward, mental health and in particular pain in psychiatry, seems to have been overlooked. However, some hospitals such as Saint-Jean-de-Dieu in Lyon have reacted by offering patients access to services within the pain consultations unit."},
